{"sections":[{"slug":"极大权模","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"极大权模"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">极大权模</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“极大权模”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>$U\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">称作极大权模是指</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">它由一个极大权向量</span> $v_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">循环生成</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $\\mathfrak nv_+=0$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">极大权模等价于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Verma模","text":"Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的商</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}